OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 80, pleads not guilty to
OL,4,Amurdering wife
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 80-year-old man has pleaded not
OL,7,Fguilty to murdering his wife at their
OL,8,Fhome.
OL,10,FOfficers had been called by paramedics
OL,11,Fto an address in Junction Road,
OL,12,FAshford, shortly after 14:00 BST on 22
OL,13,FMay, following the unexpected death of
OL,14,FJill Ellis, 78, Surrey Police
OL,15,Fpreviously said.
OL,17,FHer husband David Ellis was then
OL,18,Fcharged with murder on 30 June.
OL,20,FHe denied the charge at Guildford Crown
OL,21,FCourt on Monday and is scheduled to
OL,22,Fstand trial there in January.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
